{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RCA (rebar-debug fast path; sibling of 3d57/a3f5, same class).\n\nMECHANISM (confirmed at runtime on main containing a3f5's fix 37d29f017c88): delivered_children_manifest loops children through delivered_now -> _attested_delivered -> compute_validity('completion-verifier') per closed child; the completion branch's fingerprint recompute + 3 legacy retries + stale-material explanation = 5 full-store scans per stale child. Counting-seam RED test: 6 scans for 1 child vs 21 for 4 (identical slope to a3f5). a3f5's snapshot in completion_child_gate does NOT cover this call path — verified, not assumed.\n\nFIX: same remedy shape — 'with material_child_index(repo_root=repo_root):' around the delivered_now loop in orchestrator.delivered_children_manifest. GREEN: scans constant (wall clock 105s -> 9s for the suite); manifest membership unchanged (true-fingerprint child delivered, stale child not). Mutation check: fix reverted -> RED (21 vs 6), restored -> 47 passed across neighbor suites (test_delivered_now, test_completion_floor, test_completion_floor_e2e, test_completion_child_gate_scan_count).\n\nATTRIBUTION (independent — does NOT share a3f5's origin 929e): git log -S shows delivered_children_manifest and its per-child delivered_now loop were introduced by c19c8eb6a56 ('feat(plan-review): completion Pass-2 sub-call', 2026-07-02, pre-trailer; message cites Story 94fd, epic 66ac). delivered_now itself (3bf189f39a3, story tied-bulb-swoop) is O(1)-per-call; the O(N) full-store cost was born WITH the manifest loop, so the origin is the loop's story: 94fd-c930-9e69-497e (tow-amok-jug). Class: plan_defect — the site was born O(5N) (nothing later broke previously-fast behavior; unlike a3f5, which regressed a previously-light gate loop), the story's plan never accounted for the scan cost against live_material_children's documented light-read contract."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787453361860500001,"uuid":"ea525885-2ded-4387-8edd-6ccba30235b1"}